Good drinks are all you'll find here. 

{Name("Mayor King")}
chugs down entire glass*

{Name("Mayor King")}
Hey, *hiccup* you know your quest is so heroic! 

{Name("Rana")}
Uh, tha-

{Name("Mayor King")}
I haven't paid our town hero in weeks! 

{Name("Rana")}
Oh, what?!

{Name("Mayor King")}
We haven't had ANY tourism! The town just doesn't have the money to pay! 

{Name("Rana")}
Why is he still here? 

{Name("Mayor King")}
I don't know! But I see him around town all the time picking up stuff people drop, barely scrounging by. He should just leave! 

{Name("Rana")}
What are you going to do to get the money? 

{Name("Mayor King")}
I don't know! 

{Name("Rana")}
Well if tourisms the problem have you thought about just opening the gate to the rest of the island? 

{Name("Mayor King")}
What a good idea! I love you so much! You're my hero!

{Name("Rana")}
Haha hey man I didn't do anything.

{Name("Mayor King")}
Oh you've done plenty! 

